      "zh": {
        "title": "FedEx MD-11 貨機降落邁阿密時衝出跑道",
        "summary": "邁阿密國際機場一度只剩一條跑道可用，聯邦航空總署暫停放行飛往邁阿密的部分航班。",
        "body": [
          "美聯社報導，FedEx 一架 MD-11 貨機於11月25日晚間降落邁阿密國際機場時衝出跑道。機場一度關閉四條跑道中的三條，美國聯邦航空總署對飛往邁阿密的航班發布地面停飛措施。",
          "AeroInside 指出，涉事貨機註冊號為 N605FE，自曼菲斯起飛，降落在26R跑道後越過跑道末端。事故原因仍待釐清。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "FedEx MD-11 overruns runway on landing in Miami",
        "summary": "Miami International Airport temporarily operated with one runway and the FAA issued a ground stop for Miami-bound traffic.",
        "body": [
          "A FedEx MD-11 freighter overran a runway while landing at Miami International Airport on the evening of November 25, the Associated Press reported. Three of the airport’s four runways temporarily closed, and the FAA issued a ground stop for flights bound for Miami.",
          "AeroInside identified the aircraft as N605FE, which departed Memphis and went beyond the end of runway 26R after touchdown. The cause remains unconfirmed."
        ]
      },
